<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting Arizona State University. Please mail official transcripts or certified copies of your last three years of high school to Admission Services, as well as any university course work you have completed.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">If the date of your graduation is not clearly listed on your transcripts, please enclose a copy of your graduation diploma.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">TOEFL, IELTS, SAT or ACT scores must be sent directly from the testing agency electronically or by mail.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We will not accept emailed or faxed copies of transcripts or academic documents.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b><u>Mail academic documents to:</u></b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div><font face="arial">PO Box 870112</font></div><div><font face="arial">Tempe, AZ 85287-0112</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please feel free to contact me.&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>